{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8beb0ac5-db0e-11ef-906e-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8beb0a93-db0e-11ef-8ca2-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":1,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否割地给智伯","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_8BEB0A93DB0E11EF8CA2A0D3651F611F_01"},{"decision_name":"是否割地给智伯","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_8BEB0A93DB0E11EF8CA2A0D3651F611F_02"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a97-db0e-11ef-99db-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「後」作「則」；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「后」作「则」；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a96-db0e-11ef-8f20-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a95-db0e-11ef-9f0d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"毛晃","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛晃","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a99-db0e-11ef-9130-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜預","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜预","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a9a-db0e-11ef-b327-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"項安世","people_name_jianti_auto":"项安世","start_index":213,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a9b-db0e-11ef-8892-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"毛","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛","start_index":366,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a9c-db0e-11ef-b020-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"項","people_name_jianti_auto":"项","start_index":368,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a9d-db0e-11ef-9b1e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":373,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a9e-db0e-11ef-a98c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"戰國","place_name_jianti_auto":"战国","start_index":381,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a9f-db0e-11ef-9561-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":388,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aa0-db0e-11ef-9e47-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"毛晃曰：邑，都邑。四井爲邑，四邑爲丘；邑方二里，丘方四里。載師以公邑之田任甸地，以家邑之田任稍地。註：公邑，謂六遂餘地。家邑，大夫之采地。此又與四井之邑不同。又都，國都；邑，縣也。左傳：凡邑有先君宗廟之主曰都，無曰邑。邑曰築，都曰城。此謂大縣邑也。杜預引周禮「四縣爲都，四井爲邑」，恐誤。四井之邑方二里，豈能容宗廟城郭！如論語「十室之邑」，西都賦「都都相望，邑邑相屬」，則是四縣四井之都邑也。若千室之邑、萬家之邑，則非井邑矣。項安世曰：小司徒井牧田野，以四井爲邑，凡三十六家；除公田四夫，凡三十二家；遂大夫會爲邑者之政，以里爲邑，凡二十五家。遂大夫蓋論里井之制，二十五家共一里門，卽六鄕之二十五家爲一閭也；小司徒蓋論溝洫之制，四井爲邑，共用一溝，卽匠人所謂「井間廣四尺深四尺謂之溝」也。居則度人之衆寡，溝則度水之衆寡，此其所以異歟！毛、項二說皆明周制，參而考之，戰國之所謂邑非周制矣。致，送至也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"毛晃曰：邑，都邑。四井为邑，四邑为丘；邑方二里，丘方四里。载师以公邑之田任甸地，以家邑之田任稍地。注：公邑，谓六遂余地。家邑，大夫之采地。此又与四井之邑不同。又都，国都；邑，县也。左传：凡邑有先君宗庙之主曰都，无曰邑。邑曰筑，都曰城。此谓大县邑也。杜预引周礼「四县为都，四井为邑」，恐误。四井之邑方二里，岂能容宗庙城郭！如论语「十室之邑」，西都赋「都都相望，邑邑相属」，则是四县四井之都邑也。若千室之邑、万家之邑，则非井邑矣。项安世曰：小司徒井牧田野，以四井为邑，凡三十六家；除公田四夫，凡三十二家；遂大夫会为邑者之政，以里为邑，凡二十五家。遂大夫盖论里井之制，二十五家共一里门，即六鄕之二十五家为一闾也；小司徒盖论沟洫之制，四井为邑，共用一沟，即匠人所谓「井间广四尺深四尺谓之沟」也。居则度人之众寡，沟则度水之众寡，此其所以异欤！毛、项二说皆明周制，参而考之，战国之所谓邑非周制矣。致，送至也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a98-db0e-11ef-94bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"任章","people_name_jianti_auto":"任章","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aa7-db0e-11ef-8eee-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏桓子","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏桓子","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aa8-db0e-11ef-b334-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"黃帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"黄帝","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aa9-db0e-11ef-8d43-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"任氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"任氏","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aaa-db0e-11ef-9531-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"風姓","people_name_jianti_auto":"风姓","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aab-db0e-11ef-a0c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太昊","people_name_jianti_auto":"太昊","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aac-db0e-11ef-82d4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"濟","place_name_jianti_auto":"济","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aad-db0e-11ef-88f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"濟州","place_name_jianti_auto":"济州","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aae-db0e-11ef-a378-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"任城","place_name_jianti_auto":"任城","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aaf-db0e-11ef-ba01-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"任章，魏桓子之相也。姓譜：黃帝二十五子，十二人各以德爲姓，第一曰任氏。又任爲風姓之國，實太昊之後，主濟祀，今濟州任城卽其地。任，市林翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"任章，魏桓子之相也。姓谱：黄帝二十五子，十二人各以德为姓，第一曰任氏。又任为风姓之国，实太昊之后，主济祀，今济州任城即其地。任，市林翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aa6-db0e-11ef-8aab-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"逸書也。敗，補邁翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"逸书也。败，补迈翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":225,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ab2-db0e-11ef-90ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"智伯","people_name_jianti_auto":"智伯","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ab5-db0e-11ef-8828-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏桓子","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏桓子","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ab6-db0e-11ef-973d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ab7-db0e-11ef-ac99-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"質，脂利翻，物相綴當也。又質讀如字，亦通。質，謂椹質也，質的也。椹質受斧，質的受矢。言智伯怒魏桓子，必加兵於魏，如椹質之受斧，質的之受矢也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"质，脂利翻，物相缀当也。又质读如字，亦通。质，谓椹质也，质的也。椹质受斧，质的受矢。言智伯怒魏桓子，必加兵于魏，如椹质之受斧，质的之受矢也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":260,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ab4-db0e-11ef-b3f0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"任章，中国春秋时期魏桓子的家臣和谋士，《战国策·赵策》作赵葭。","link_td_id":"Q10015021","link_td_number_id":3261762,"people_name":"任章","people_name_jianti_auto":"任章","people_xingming":"任章","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ac3-db0e-11ef-a301-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"任章，中国春秋时期魏桓子的家臣和谋士，《战国策·赵策》作赵葭。","link_td_id":"Q10015021","link_td_number_id":3261762,"people_name":"任章","people_name_jianti_auto":"任章","people_xingming":"任章","start_index":141,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ac5-db0e-11ef-906e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8beb0a93-db0e-11ef-8ca2-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"niǔ","source_anchor_text":"如與之彼狃於得地必","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":40,"text":"狃","tongjian_id":"98c15361-3980-584d-95da-eea96431aa5c"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"智伯請地於韓康子，康子欲弗與。段規曰：「智伯好利而愎，不與，將伐我；不如與之。彼狃於得地，必請於他人；他人不與，必嚮之以兵，然後我得免於患而待事之變矣。」康子曰：「善。」使使者致萬家之邑於智伯。智伯悅。又求地於魏桓子，桓子欲弗與。任章曰：「何故弗與？」桓子曰：「無故索地，故弗與。」任章曰：「無故索地，諸大夫必懼；吾與之地，智伯必驕。彼驕而輕敵，此懼而相親；以相親之兵待輕敵之人，智氏之命必不長矣。周書曰：『將欲敗之，必姑輔之。將欲取之，必姑與之。』主不如與之，以驕智伯，然後可以擇交而圖智氏矣，柰何獨以吾爲智氏質乎！」桓子曰：「善。」復與之萬家之邑一。","content_fanyi":"智伯瑶向韩康子索要土地，韩康子不想给。段规说：“智瑶贪财而又刚愎自用，如果不给，他就会攻打我们；不如给他。他因轻易得地而更加骄纵，必定会再向别人索要；别人不给，他一定会对人家用兵。这样我们就能免于祸患，静观事态变化。”韩康子说：“好。”于是派使者把一座有万户人家的城邑送给了智伯。智伯很高兴。他又向魏桓子索要土地，魏桓子不想给。任章说：“为什么不给？”魏桓子说：“无缘无故索要土地，所以不给。”任章说：“智瑶无缘无故索要土地，各位大夫一定害怕；我们给他土地，智瑶一定骄傲。他骄傲就会轻视敌人，我们害怕就会互相亲近；用互相亲近的军队对付轻敌的人，智氏的性命一定不会长久了。《周书》说：‘想要打败他，必须先暂且帮助他；想要夺取他，必须先暂且给他。’主公不如给他，让智瑶骄傲，然后就可以选择结交盟友来图谋智氏了，为什么偏偏要让我们做智氏的靶子呢！”魏桓子说：“好。”又给了智伯瑶一座有万户人家的城邑。","content_jianti_auto":"智伯请地于韩康子，康子欲弗与。段规曰：「智伯好利而愎，不与，将伐我；不如与之。彼狃于得地，必请于他人；他人不与，必向之以兵，然后我得免于患而待事之变矣。」康子曰：「善。」使使者致万家之邑于智伯。智伯悦。又求地于魏桓子，桓子欲弗与。任章曰：「何故弗与？」桓子曰：「无故索地，故弗与。」任章曰：「无故索地，诸大夫必惧；吾与之地，智伯必骄。彼骄而轻敌，此惧而相亲；以相亲之兵待轻敌之人，智氏之命必不长矣。周书曰：『将欲败之，必姑辅之。将欲取之，必姑与之。』主不如与之，以骄智伯，然后可以择交而图智氏矣，柰何独以吾为智氏质乎！」桓子曰：「善。」复与之万家之邑一。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":13,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 威烈王 / 二十三年 / 第 13 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8beb0a93-db0e-11ef-8ca2-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-403},"tongjian_id":"8beb0a93-db0e-11ef-8ca2-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"袁","people_name_jianti_auto":"袁","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1ad-db0e-11ef-95b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"梁不疑","people_name_jianti_auto":"梁不疑","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1ae-db0e-11ef-aa77-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"范","people_name_jianti_auto":"范","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1af-db0e-11ef-9c0f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：袁紀作「梁不疑府」，今從范書。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：袁纪作「梁不疑府」，今从范书。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1ac-db0e-11ef-bc00-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1b4-db0e-11ef-8ee3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1b5-db0e-11ef-a721-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：蹕，止行人也。靜室，謂先使清宮也。前書音義曰：漢有靜室令。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：跸，止行人也。静室，谓先使清宫也。前书音义曰：汉有静室令。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1b3-db0e-11ef-9ae9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢官儀曰：前驅有雲䍐、皮軒、鑾旗車。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉官仪曰：前驱有云䍐、皮轩、銮旗车。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1b7-db0e-11ef-9325-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"陳靈公","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈灵公","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1ba-db0e-11ef-bff0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"夏徵舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"夏征舒","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1bb-db0e-11ef-85d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"徵舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"征舒","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1bc-db0e-11ef-a5aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"齊莊公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐庄公","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1bd-db0e-11ef-be4c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"崔杼","people_name_jianti_auto":"崔杼","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1be-db0e-11ef-b5b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杼","people_name_jianti_auto":"杼","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1bf-db0e-11ef-b651-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳：陳靈公如夏徵舒之家，爲徵舒所弒。齊莊公如崔杼之家，亦爲杼所弒。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传：陈灵公如夏征舒之家，为征舒所弑。齐庄公如崔杼之家，亦为杼所弑。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1b9-db0e-11ef-bf76-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1c2-db0e-11ef-830a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：等威，謂威儀有等差也。左氏傳曰：貴有常尊，賤有等威。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：等威，谓威仪有等差也。左氏传曰：贵有常尊，贱有等威。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1c1-db0e-11ef-86c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宣帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"宣帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1c6-db0e-11ef-a83f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"任宣","people_name_jianti_auto":"任宣","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1c7-db0e-11ef-9623-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宣","people_name_jianti_auto":"宣","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1c8-db0e-11ef-8c9a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1c9-db0e-11ef-817e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1ca-db0e-11ef-bece-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宣帝時，任宣坐謀反誅。宣子章亡在渭城界，中夜玄服入廟，居廊間，執戟立於廟門，待上至，欲爲逆；發覺，伏誅。任，音壬。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宣帝时，任宣坐谋反诛。宣子章亡在渭城界，中夜玄服入庙，居廊间，执戟立于庙门，待上至，欲为逆；发觉，伏诛。任，音壬。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":151,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1c5-db0e-11ef-9275-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"河南尹","official_note":"河南尹是东汉时期管理河南郡（今洛阳一带）的地方行政长官，相当于郡守，但地位较高，因地处京师附近。在上下文中，皇帝微行至河南尹梁胤的府舍，这反映了皇帝私访地方官员的行为，可能涉及尊卑失序的问题。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"幸河南尹梁胤府舍","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"83ef010b-02ae-4c44-ade5-586bb72c1130"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"尚書","official_note":"尚書是东汉时期中央政府的官员，负责处理文书和政令，属于尚书台，是重要的中枢行政职务。在上下文中，尚书杨秉上疏劝谏皇帝，体现了其作为谏官或行政官员的职能。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"尚書楊秉上疏曰","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"da22eaa5-6046-4214-bda2-aa60d83359d2"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"任章，中国春秋时期魏桓子的家臣和谋士，《战国策·赵策》作赵葭。","link_td_id":"Q10015021","link_td_number_id":3261762,"people_name":"任章","people_name_jianti_auto":"任章","people_xingming":"任章","start_index":146,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1cf-db0e-11ef-aca8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"96d4f1ab-db0e-11ef-8021-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"pán","source_anchor_text":"服而私出槃游降亂尊","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":114,"text":"槃","tongjian_id":"330af4a2-31a5-52fb-8830-b4a986a5922a"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"4夏，四月，己丑，上微行，幸河南尹梁胤府舍。是日，大風拔樹，晝昏。尚書楊秉上疏曰：「臣聞天不言語，以災異譴告。王者至尊，出入有常，警蹕而行，靜室而止，自非郊廟之事，則鑾旗不駕。故諸侯入諸臣之家，春秋尚列其誡；況於以先王法服而私出槃游，降亂尊卑，等威無序，侍衞守空宮，璽紱委女妾！設有非常之變，任章之謀，上負先帝，下悔靡及！」帝不納。秉，震之子也。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月，己丑日，桓帝微行，临幸河南尹梁胤府舍。当日，大风拔起树木，白昼昏暗。尚书杨秉上疏说：“臣听说上天并不言语，而是用灾异来谴责告诫。君王最为尊贵，出入有常规，出宫时警跸清道、左右侍卫，入宫时静室清宫然后才止宿；除非郊庙祭祀之事，否则銮旗车驾不轻易出动。因此诸侯进入臣属之家，《春秋》尚且列为鉴戒；何况穿着先王规定的法服而私自出宫游乐，降低扰乱了尊卑次序，威仪等级失去秩序，侍卫守着空宫，天子的玺绂交给后宫姬妾！假如发生非常之变，出现任章那样的图谋，对上辜负先帝，对下追悔莫及！”桓帝不予采纳。杨秉，是杨震之子。","content_jianti_auto":"4夏，四月，己丑，上微行，幸河南尹梁胤府舍。是日，大风拔树，昼昏。尚书杨秉上疏曰：「臣闻天不言语，以灾异谴告。王者至尊，出入有常，警跸而行，静室而止，自非郊庙之事，则銮旗不驾。故诸侯入诸臣之家，春秋尚列其诫；况于以先王法服而私出槃游，降乱尊卑，等威无序，侍衞守空宫，玺绂委女妾！设有非常之变，任章之谋，上负先帝，下悔靡及！」帝不纳。秉，震之子也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4527,"number":4,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第五十三 (漢紀四十五) / 孝桓皇帝上之上 / 元嘉元年 / 第 4 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"96d4f1ab-db0e-11ef-8021-a0d3651f611f","year_int":151},"tongjian_id":"96d4f1ab-db0e-11ef-8021-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2}],"page_size":7,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":2},"profile":{"alias_list":["赵葭"],"biography":"任章，中国春秋时期魏桓子的家臣和谋士，《战国策·赵策》作赵葭。","link_td_id":"Q10015021","name":"任章","number_id":3261762},"relationships":[{"direction":"forward","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"家臣与主君关系，来源文本：任章，中国春秋时期魏桓子的家臣和谋士","relation_property_id":"P100061","relation_property_label":"其他关系","source_person_id":"Q10015021","source_person_name":"任章","source_person_number_id":3261762,"statement_id":"S-Q10015021-P100061-Q10001809","target_person_id":"Q10001809","target_person_name":"魏驹","target_person_number_id":459836}]},"message":"success","success":true}